### Test 1: Create a new thread and post using categoryId
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "b4811e0c-adc1-49f2-8115-826721b5f72c",
  "title": "zxvzxcv",
  "content": "zxcvzxcvzxdsffsdf",
  "tags": ["fertility"]
}

### Test 2: Create a reply to an existing post (using threadId)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "threadId": "aa2a045b-fbd3-4f2c-91fa-62bd60d4b6a2",
  "content": "This is a reply to the morning sickness thread",
  "parentId": "existing-post-id-here"
}

### Test 3: Create a new post in existing thread (using threadId only)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "threadId": "aa2a045b-fbd3-4f2c-91fa-62bd60d4b6a2",
  "content": "This is a new post in the morning sickness thread"
}

### Test 4: Get threads by category (Use existing forum-threads endpoint)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-threads/category/b4811e0c-adc1-49f2-8115-826721b5f72c
Content-Type: application/json
